{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/schedule(_:daemonname:_:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"title":"schedule(_:daemonName:_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"daemonName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","text":"Timetable"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"GnustoClock","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"GnustoClock"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11GnustoClock0B0V8schedule_10daemonName_0A010TimedEventVAF5ActorV_SSAA9TimetableVtF"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"daemonName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timetable","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timetable","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Timetable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whose day this is."}]}],"name":"actor"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon’s name, unique across the whole game.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"daemonName"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The day to keep."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"timetable"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The timed event, for the game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the deterministic counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"code":"GnustoActors","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’ ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announcement discipline is the same — the departure line prints only if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the player is standing in the room being left, the arrival line only in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the room being entered, and neither in the dark — but nothing here draws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the seeded random stream, because a suspect whose movements are a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"coin flip has no alibi worth checking.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Movement is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"teleport to the scheduled room, with no exit-graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"awareness"}]},{"text":": a locked door on the route will not stop him. The contract","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a timetable is keeping is that he ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"text":" in the study at a quarter past —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not that he plausibly got there.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the physical journey matters, there are two ways to say so and they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not interchangeable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make the room he passes through a stop of its own."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" He is really","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"there, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"location(of:at:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will say so and any testimony read off","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the timetable inherits it. Costs a tick: the stop has to land on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time the clock actually samples, which on a multi-minute turn means","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"taking one off a neighbouring leg.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Say it from the stop that already moves him","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"say(_:from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" naming the room passed through. The line"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints on the same turn as that stop’s own departure and arrival, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in that room only. The timetable does not learn anything — he is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still a teleport, and a lookup will not place him on the grass — so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"take this one when the crossing is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"narration"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and the stop times are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"load-bearing elsewhere.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Fulminate"},{"text":" uses both: five actors on stops, and one crossing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose middle leg is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"text":" line because the minutes on either side","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of it are quoted by a witness.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An actor with no room — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"text":"ed, shut in a chest, carried off —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"idles: the daemon does nothing and leaves the timetable’s place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"untouched, so he picks his day back up where he left it if he is put","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"down again. An actor merely ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"moved"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" somewhere off his route, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast, walks back on the next tick, because a timetable means he goes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"where he is supposed to be. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To take him off his rounds for good —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrested, murdered, sent away — call ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Timer names are global across a game; the convention here is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"<actor>.day\""},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts an actor on a timetable: a daemon that keeps them where their day"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says they should be."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:daemonName:_:)"},"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Actor":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A character in the world — a troll, a thief, a parrot."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Actor","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/actor","title":"Actor","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/schedule(_:daemonName:_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts an actor on a timetable: a daemon that keeps them where their day"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"says they should be.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:daemonName:_:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/schedule(_:daemonname:_:)","title":"schedule(_:daemonName:_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"daemonName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Timetable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}]},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock","title":"GnustoClock","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts a wall clock over the engine’s turn counter, so a game can be played"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against an evening rather than a move count."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TimedEvent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","title":"TimedEvent","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TimedEvent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A named timed event, declared in a game or bundle "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block: a fuse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(fires once, N turns after it is started) or a daemon (runs at the end of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every turn while active). The body is registered at bootstrap and never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"serialized; only the schedule — name → turns remaining, or the active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flag — lives in "},{"code":"WorldState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so it saves and restores like any other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"state and a restore re-binds it to the declared body by name."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/timedevent"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Timetable":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Timetable","title":"Timetable","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timetable","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Timetable","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An actor’s day, written down: a list of stops the clock walks them through."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/timetable"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock","title":"Clock","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A wall clock over the turn counter: a game where it is twenty to six, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ten to six four turns later.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock"}}}